    "seoDescription": "Agent observability analysis with sources, charts and an ALTOS LAB editorial lens for how teams can manage automation with task, cost and rollback signals.",
    "excerpt": "When Agent observability moves from news to operations, teams need a source-backed way to manage automation with task, cost and rollback signals without losing quality…",
    "contentType": "column",
